              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵana upile ŵele ŵakusacapa mikanjo jawo mwakujiswejesya, kuti akole ukoto wakulya yisogosi ya mcitela cakupeleka umi, ni kwinjila mu msinda kupitila pa yipata.",
          "type": "text",
