              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Une Yohane, ngumtetela jwalijose jwakugapikana maloŵe ga m'buku ajinoga gigakusala ya yiticitendekwa msogolo. Naga jwine tacijonjecesyapo kandu pa maloŵe gelega, Mlungu tacimjonjecesya pa cilango cakwe milili jajilembedwe m'bukumu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
